==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*20 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
*3 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage primarily serves as a treasure check stage for Cats of the Cosmos. As such, it is advised you obtain all Cats of the Cosmos treasures to make the Weyland in this stage much easier to handle.

